{"path":"io/basic_ospanstream/basic_ospanstream","title":"std::basic_ospanstream<CharT,Traits>::basic_ospanstream","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ospanstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>basic_ospanstream","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ospanstream/basic_ospanstream","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs a new basic_ospanstream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> basic_ospanstream<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> s, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1688\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">openmode</span></span></a> mode <span class=\"sy1\">=</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ospanstream<span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_ospanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ospanstream<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_ospanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a new <code>basic_ospanstream</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Uses the storage referenced by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s</span></code> as initial underlying buffer of the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span> device. The wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span> object is constructed as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_spanbuf<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Char, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s, mode <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Move constructor. Move constructs the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> base subobject and the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span> from those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>, and then calls <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/set_rdbuf\">set_rdbuf</a></span> with the address of the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span> in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> to install it.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Copy constructor is deleted. <code>basic_ospanstream</code> is not copyable.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> s\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-lc\">std::span</span> referencing the storage to be use as initial underlying buffer of stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> mode\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> specifies stream open mode. Following constants and bit-wise OR between them may be used:\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Constant\n</td>\n<td> Explanation\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>app</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> seek to the end of stream before each write\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>binary</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> open in <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/FILE#Binary_and_text_modes\">binary mode</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>in</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> open for reading\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>out</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> open for writing\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>trunc</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> discard the contents of the stream when opening\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>ate</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> seek to the end of stream immediately after open\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><code>noreplace</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span>\n</td>\n<td> open in exclusive mode\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>basic_ospanstream</code> to be moved from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_spanbuf/basic_spanbuf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>basic_spanbuf</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_spanbuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ospanstream","title":"std::basic_ospanstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ospanstream<CharT,Traits>::basic_ospanstream","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Constructs a new basic_ospanstream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"s, mode, other","children":[{"label":"app","note":"seek to the end of stream before each write"},{"label":"binary","note":"open in binary mode"},{"label":"in","note":"open for reading"},{"label":"out","note":"open for writing"},{"label":"trunc","note":"discard the contents of the stream when opening"},{"label":"ate","note":"seek to the end of stream immediately after open"},{"label":"noreplace (C++23)","note":"open in exclusive mode"}]},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a basic_spanbuf object"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":216,"codeBlockCount":0}
